          <div class="card-editorial">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-sm text-stone-900 mb-3">Nak tahu NCD anda?</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 mb-3">Semak NCD secara online melalui:</p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
              <li>
                <a href="https://www.mycarinfo.com.my/ncdcheck/online" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-hijau-700 font-medium hover:text-hijau-600">Semakan NCD MyCarInfo</a>
                <span class="text-stone-500"> (<a href="https://www.zurich.com.my/knowledge-hub/articles/2023/getting-to-know-ncd-no-claim-discount" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-hijau-700 underline">rujukan Zurich</a>)</span>
              </li>
              <li class="text-stone-600">Atau tanya ejen / syarikat insurans anda terus</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card-editorial">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-sm text-stone-900 mb-2">Tip penting</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-stone-600">
              Bandingkan <strong>kos repair, excess dan kesan NCD</strong> dengan syarikat sebelum claim.
              Semak jenis tuntutan dalam <a href="/guides/ncd-explained/" class="text-hijau-700 underline">panduan NCD</a>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>

    </div>
  </div>
